  "rationale": "Swagit recording 233032 (May 25, 2023) is titled '2024 Capital Bond Streets and Transportation Meeting' (provider-player; native-source-chapters). Official minutes hosted on dallascityhall.com for the same May 25, 2023 meeting header it 'Streets and Transportation Subcommittee / 2024 Bond Task Force', with a committee roll call (Chair Linda Koop, members by district), convened/adjourned times, and TRN (Transportation) and PBW (Public Works) staff presenters (dallas-streets-may25), matching the recording's date and topic. This proves the convened body is the Streets and Transportation Subcommittee of the 2024 Bond Task Force under Dallas' 2024 capital bond program. The existing feed 'Dallas: 2024 Bond Streets and Transportation Subcommittee' (dallas-tx-2024-bond-streets-and-transportation-subcommittee, described as 'Dallas 2024 bond Streets and Transportation subcommittee proceedings') matches this proven body exactly, so publication_action is assign_existing. Per the identity policy, the convened subcommittee—not the parent task force, venue, topic, or presenters—determines ownership; the Public Works and Transportation departments supplied staff presentations, which do not confer body ownership and for which no configured feed exists. The full 2024 Community Bond Task Force did not convene or jointly participate, so its feed is not selected; the generic dallas-tx-bond-program-meetings feed is unnecessary because a body-specific configured feed exists. Empty membership is not implicated here since the body is proven and configured."
